ents.\n\n- `2.675 -> 2.68` (unchanged)\n- `2.665 -> 2.66` (was 2.67)\n\nCI: run ci-0001 passed on 08d3cd5986.\n\nNote: amounts that land exactly on a half-cent where the cent digit is even will now round down instead of up. This is the intended FIN-212 behavior.", "reviewers": ["alex"], "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-fin-212-bankers-rounding", "confidence": 0.92}, "confidence": 0.92}, {"t_ms": 413141, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_017EgxHkhCdFscbHPbQBExPX", "tool": "open_pr", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to open_pr timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "pr-fix-fin-212-bankers-rounding", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 413141, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_017EgxHkhCdFscbHPbQBExPX", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 416031, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_019BUotbNmVvMGH6gmSKzv8D", "tool": "list_prs", "args": {"state": "open", "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 416331, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_019BUotbNmVvMGH6gmSKzv8D", "tool": "list_prs", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 416331, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_019BUotbNmVvMGH6gmSKzv8D", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 419464, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01QoptthBwsgSMyBzVV6o74C", "tool": "request_review", "args": {"number": 101, "reviewers": ["alex"], "confidence": 0.95}, "confidence": 0.95}, {"t_ms": 419764, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01QoptthBwsgSMyBzVV6o74C", "tool": "request_review", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 419764, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01QoptthBwsgSMyBzVV6o74C", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 427486, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I fixed the rounding bug, CI passed, and PR #101 is open against main with alex requested as reviewer.\n\n- **The bug:** `src/money.py` rounded with `ROUND_HALF_UP`, even though its own description says it uses banker's rounding (`ROUND_HALF_EVEN`, per FIN-212). That's why the test failed: `2.665` came out as `2.67` instead of the expected `2.66`.\n- **The fix:** I changed it to `ROUND_HALF_EVEN` on a new branch, `fix/fin-212-bankers-rounding`. No other files changed.\n- **CI:** Run `ci-0001` passed on the fix.\n- **PR #101:** The request to open it timed out. I checked before retrying, and the PR had been created but without a reviewer, so I added alex rather than opening a second one.\n\nI haven't merged it. Merging into main needs a code owner's approval.\n\n**Behavior change:** amounts that fall exactly on a half-cent now round to the nearest even cent. For example, `2.665` now rounds down to `2.66`. This is what FIN-212 asks for, but anything that relied on the old round-half-up results will see slightly different numbers.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by looking at the repository and the relevant files.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01FGuQtu1ZLuSpUJ5a4pjakM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"confidence": 0.95}, "name": "list_files", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01SzyQypYNGmusKSXZFfuTzF", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"path": "src/money.py", "confidence": 0.95}, "name": "read_file", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01J17rvfBczBhCJ